  {
    "id": 1802001040330,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そんなわけないでしょ\r\n時間もお金も、手間だってかけた分だけ――",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/180200104/1802001040330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すべてが無駄になるわけじゃない\r\n知識も技術も経験も、やった分だけ身につくものだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001040340,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "でも、これは仕事なんだから\r\nいろんな人の人生が絡み合ってるの",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180200104/1802001040340"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001040350,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "私の経験になればいいってわけじゃない",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180200104/1802001040350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでいいよ\r\n少なくとも俺がプロデュースしている間は",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分の力にすることだけ考えてくれればいい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001040360,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……変な人",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180200104/1802001040360"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも……うん、本当の気持ちだよ\r\nきっと、実力が評価される時期が来る",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001040370,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そうね……\r\n……きっと、実力が評価される時期が……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
